		"description": {
			"baseEffect": "<p><strong>Tier 3 · 2 Actions · Burst 3.</strong></p><p><strong>Damage:</strong> 4d4+12. On a failed STR save, Medium or smaller targets are pushed out of the area. If you are Charged, targets have disadvantage on their save.</p><p><em>What is Placed? Placing a target means they aren't subjected to rules involving forced movement or terrain.</em></p>",
			"higherLevelEffect": "",
			"upcastEffect": "<p><strong>Upcast:</strong> Choose 1: +4 damage, Burst +1, affected size +1 (max Huge). If 8+ mana is spent, targets of your choice take no damage and can be placed anywhere in the area (including yourself).</p>"
